refused: d220_narrowing_shortened_bare.cy:5:1, line 5 column 1
 5 | use std::io::fmt_print.stored as stored;
   | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 fix:  `use std::io::fmt_print as fmt_print;`
 why:  a function's narrowing means something only next to its function, so it isn't shortened to its bare name, though a quoted name is your own choice (D220, D150)
